 barcode reader \u2014 and a full generator \u2014 inside a sleek holographic HUD.\n\n  \ud83d\udcf7 SCAN\n  \u25b8 Point at any QR or barcode \u2014 detected instantly through passthrough, no phone needed\n  \u25b8 One-tap smart actions: open links, join Wi-Fi, save contacts, dial, maps, calendar\n  \u25b8 Built-in offline safety check warns about phishing & suspicious links\n\n  \u2728 GENERATE\n  \u25b8 Create QR codes for links, Wi-Fi & text with the in-VR keyboard\n  \u25b8 Save them to your headset's Downloads folder\n\n  \ud83d\udccb ORGANIZE\n  \u25b8 Searchable history of everything you scan & generate \u2014 favorites, notes, re-actions\n  \u25b8 Export to PDF, CSV, JSON or TXT\n\n  \ud83e\uddca MADE FOR MIXED REALITY\n  \u25b8 Multi-panel holographic workspace you can grab & arrange\n  \u25b8 Comfortable & stationary \u2014 seated or standing\n  \u25b8 Runs on-device only: no ads, no accounts, no trackers\n\n  \ud83d\udcac Join our community on Discord: https://discord.gg/u76eFWjeV\n\n  \u26a0 Scanning uses Meta's Passthrough Camera API \u2014 requires Quest 3 or Quest 3S", "short_description": "Turn your Quest 3 or 3S into a powerful QR and barcode scanner \u2014 no phone needed. Just look at any code through passthrough and it's detected instantly, with smart actions to open links, join Wi-Fi, save contacts, dial numbers and more. A built-in generator lets you create your own QR codes for links, Wi-Fi and text, then save them to your headset. Every scan is checked for unsafe links, and your full history is kept, searchable and exportable \u2014 all in a sleek holographic interface."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://f1tt0n.github.io/qr-scanner-generator/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Anwar Studio Official", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/u76eFWjeV", "website_url": "https://f1tt0n.github.io/qr-scanner-generator/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR